{
  "0": [
    {
      "text": "two brothers owned one-third of the",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.2800000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "world's silver supply, then the market",
      "startSec": 2.2800000000000002,
      "endSec": 4.63
    },
    {
      "text": "changed the rules.",
      "startSec": 4.63,
      "endSec": 5.24
    }
  ],
  "1": [
    {
      "text": "Silver started the 1970s at about $1.50",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 3.5
    },
    {
      "text": "an ounce.",
      "startSec": 3.5,
      "endSec": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "By January 18, 1980, it hit $49.45.",
      "startSec": 4.08,
      "endSec": 7.52
    },
    {
      "text": "That is a 33 times increase in seven",
      "startSec": 7.52,
      "endSec": 9.65
    },
    {
      "text": "years.",
      "startSec": 9.65,
      "endSec": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Not because demand exploded, because",
      "startSec": 10,
      "endSec": 11.76
    },
    {
      "text": "two brothers from Texas decided to own",
      "startSec": 11.76,
      "endSec": 13.36
    },
    {
      "text": "most of the world's silver supply.",
      "startSec": 13.36,
      "endSec": 14.96
    }
  ],
  "2": [
    {
      "text": "Nelson Bunker Hunt and William Herbert",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 1.94
    },
    {
      "text": "Hunt, working with Arab partners,",
      "startSec": 1.94,
      "endSec": 3.67
    },
    {
      "text": "accumulated over",
      "startSec": 3.67,
      "endSec": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "100 million ounces of silver through",
      "startSec": 4.2,
      "endSec": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "physical holdings and futures contracts",
      "startSec": 6.24,
      "endSec": 8.31
    },
    {
      "text": ".",
      "startSec": 8.31,
      "endSec": 8.34
    },
    {
      "text": "That was approximately one-third of all",
      "startSec": 8.34,
      "endSec": 9.84
    },
    {
      "text": "non-government silver in the world.",
      "startSec": 9.84,
      "endSec": 11.38
    },
    {
      "text": "No single entity had ever controlled",
      "startSec": 11.38,
      "endSec": 12.63
    },
    {
      "text": "that share of a global commodity.",
      "startSec": 12.63,
      "endSec": 13.92
    }
  ],
  "3": [
    {
      "text": "The brothers started accumulating in",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.1
    },
    {
      "text": "1973 when silver was around $1.50 per",
      "startSec": 2.1,
      "endSec": 4.86
    },
    {
      "text": "ounce.",
      "startSec": 4.86,
      "endSec": 5.5
    },
    {
      "text": "They were convinced paper money would",
      "startSec": 5.5,
      "endSec": 7.35
    },
    {
      "text": "collapse.",
      "startSec": 7.35,
      "endSec": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "The 1970s brought real inflation and",
      "startSec": 8,
      "endSec": 10.1
    },
    {
      "text": "currency pain.",
      "startSec": 10.1,
      "endSec": 11.5
    },
    {
      "text": "But they made the mistake of thinking",
      "startSec": 11.5,
      "endSec": 12.54
    },
    {
      "text": "they could force the outcome they",
      "startSec": 12.54,
      "endSec": 14.02
    },
    {
      "text": "expected.",
      "startSec": 14.02,
      "endSec": 14.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Markets do not cooperate with anyone",
      "startSec": 14.5,
      "endSec": 16.3
    },
    {
      "text": "that long.",
      "startSec": 16.3,
      "endSec": 17
    }
  ],
  "4": [
    {
      "text": "In January 1980, the COMEX exchange",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 3.1
    },
    {
      "text": "implemented what became known as Silver",
      "startSec": 3.1,
      "endSec": 5.15
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule 7.",
      "startSec": 5.15,
      "endSec": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Traders could only close existing",
      "startSec": 5.92,
      "endSec": 7.47
    },
    {
      "text": "silver positions.",
      "startSec": 7.47,
      "endSec": 8.48
    },
    {
      "text": "They could not open new long contracts.",
      "startSec": 8.48,
      "endSec": 10.74
    },
    {
      "text": "This removed the buying pressure that",
      "startSec": 10.74,
      "endSec": 12.28
    },
    {
      "text": "had driven prices up.",
      "startSec": 12.28,
      "endSec": 13.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Prices began falling immediately.",
      "startSec": 13.32,
      "endSec": 14.96
    },
    {
      "text": "The mechanism sustaining the squeeze",
      "startSec": 14.96,
      "endSec": 16.53
    },
    {
      "text": "was gone.",
      "startSec": 16.53,
      "endSec": 17.04
    }
  ],
  "5": [
    {
      "text": "On March 27, 1980, the Hunt Brothers",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 3.05
    },
    {
      "text": "could not meet a 135 million margin",
      "startSec": 3.05,
      "endSec": 4.89
    },
    {
      "text": "call from their",
      "startSec": 4.89,
      "endSec": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Broker Batch Group.",
      "startSec": 5.4,
      "endSec": 6.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Batch liquidated their positions on the",
      "startSec": 6.92,
      "endSec": 8.54
    },
    {
      "text": "open market.",
      "startSec": 8.54,
      "endSec": 9.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Silver fell from roughly 21 to 10.80 in",
      "startSec": 9.24,
      "endSec": 11.85
    },
    {
      "text": "a single session.",
      "startSec": 11.85,
      "endSec": 12.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Brokerage firms nearly collapsed.",
      "startSec": 12.88,
      "endSec": 14.6
    },
    {
      "text": "The Federal Reserve coordinated a 1.1",
      "startSec": 14.6,
      "endSec": 16.36
    },
    {
      "text": "billion emergency loan from a",
      "startSec": 16.36,
      "endSec": 17.44
    },
    {
      "text": "consortium of banks",
      "startSec": 17.44,
      "endSec": 18.32
    },
    {
      "text": "to prevent a broader financial crisis.",
      "startSec": 18.32,
      "endSec": 19.96
    }
  ],
  "6": [
    {
      "text": "The chart tells the story. Seven years",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.11
    },
    {
      "text": "of gradual accumulation, a vertical",
      "startSec": 2.11,
      "endSec": 3.95
    },
    {
      "text": "spike to 49 in early 1980,",
      "startSec": 3.95,
      "endSec": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "then a single session collapsed back to",
      "startSec": 6,
      "endSec": 7.78
    },
    {
      "text": "10. The spike was artificial. The",
      "startSec": 7.78,
      "endSec": 9.68
    },
    {
      "text": "collapse was",
      "startSec": 9.68,
      "endSec": 10.08
    },
    {
      "text": "structural. Markets are very good at",
      "startSec": 10.08,
      "endSec": 11.61
    },
    {
      "text": "correcting artificial price levels once",
      "startSec": 11.61,
      "endSec": 13.28
    },
    {
      "text": "the mechanism",
      "startSec": 13.28,
      "endSec": 13.76
    },
    {
      "text": "is sustaining the brakes.",
      "startSec": 13.76,
      "endSec": 18.72
    }
  ],
  "7": [
    {
      "text": "The Hunt brothers avoided criminal",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.02
    },
    {
      "text": "charges.",
      "startSec": 2.02,
      "endSec": 2.88
    },
    {
      "text": "In 1989, they settled civil claims",
      "startSec": 2.88,
      "endSec": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "brought by the CFTC and a Peruvian",
      "startSec": 5.04,
      "endSec": 6.73
    },
    {
      "text": "mining company called",
      "startSec": 6.73,
      "endSec": 7.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Minpaco for a combined 134 million.",
      "startSec": 7.52,
      "endSec": 10.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Nelson Hunt filed for personal",
      "startSec": 10.92,
      "endSec": 12.22
    },
    {
      "text": "bankruptcy in 1988, listing 2.5 billion",
      "startSec": 12.22,
      "endSec": 14.84
    },
    {
      "text": "in liabilities.",
      "startSec": 14.84,
      "endSec": 15.64
    }
  ],
  "8": [
    {
      "text": "After the 1980 collapse, Silver traded",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 1.8399999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "between 4 and 10 dollars for most of",
      "startSec": 1.8399999999999999,
      "endSec": 3.48
    },
    {
      "text": "the next two decades.",
      "startSec": 3.48,
      "endSec": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "The medal did not revisit 49 until",
      "startSec": 4.88,
      "endSec": 6.6
    },
    {
      "text": "April 2011, 31 years later.",
      "startSec": 6.6,
      "endSec": 8.72
    },
    {
      "text": "That time, the move was driven by real",
      "startSec": 8.72,
      "endSec": 10.1
    },
    {
      "text": "industrial demand from electronics and",
      "startSec": 10.1,
      "endSec": 11.52
    },
    {
      "text": "solar panels.",
      "startSec": 11.52,
      "endSec": 12.48
    },
    {
      "text": "A completely different story underneath",
      "startSec": 12.48,
      "endSec": 14.43
    },
    {
      "text": ".",
      "startSec": 14.43,
      "endSec": 14.64
    }
  ],
  "9": [
    {
      "text": "Investors holding physical silver at",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.06
    },
    {
      "text": "the 1980 peak took losses when the",
      "startSec": 2.06,
      "endSec": 3.89
    },
    {
      "text": "price collapsed,",
      "startSec": 3.89,
      "endSec": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "but they still held the metal.",
      "startSec": 5.08,
      "endSec": 6.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Traders who held leveraged futures",
      "startSec": 6.88,
      "endSec": 8.27
    },
    {
      "text": "contracts faced margin calls they could",
      "startSec": 8.27,
      "endSec": 9.86
    },
    {
      "text": "not meet and",
      "startSec": 9.86,
      "endSec": 10.4
    },
    {
      "text": "lost everything.",
      "startSec": 10.4,
      "endSec": 11.68
    },
    {
      "text": "The difference between a physical",
      "startSec": 11.68,
      "endSec": 12.76
    },
    {
      "text": "position and a paper position was the",
      "startSec": 12.76,
      "endSec": 13.91
    },
    {
      "text": "difference between",
      "startSec": 13.91,
      "endSec": 14.6
    },
    {
      "text": "a loss and a total wipeout.",
      "startSec": 14.6,
      "endSec": 16.24
    }
  ],
  "10": [
    {
      "text": "Follow for more Silver News.",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 1.8399999999999999
    }
  ]
}